{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_ui_act5d0_firstenter","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_01","title":"序章","storyCode":"ENTRY","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/ui_act5d0_firstenter.txt","sourceHash":"b4a891f5030846c918d5373911bae76a70aa8bd479ae3575c5f45c6087630559","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:37 P.M.    天氣/多雲\n龍門日落大道，某酒吧，靠後門邊最後一張沒擦乾淨的桌子"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"黑桃J，同花順，又是我贏了，甘比諾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"是你贏了，但你藏牌的速度比我用腳趾還慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你又想賴帳了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"給我閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴？你昨晚怎麼不知道閉嘴？那樣能省不少事，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你在龍門待的有點久了，卡彭。也許你該回憶一下怎麼和我說話，我才是首領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"坐下，你這蠢貨，敘拉古的生意越來越差就是因為你的好脾氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你在龍門待了七八年，除了學到幾句龍門粗口，你又幹了什麼？眼睜睜看著我們的管道越來越少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"至少昨天贏得了那位支持的人是我，而你，差點毀了我這麼長久的努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，在龍門我們平起平坐，“首領”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王在龍門搞的這一套，不都是敘拉古玩爛了的把戲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你把敘拉古的一手好牌打得稀爛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"而你就是我手裡最爛的一張牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會在龍門佔據一席之地的。好好想想，一座疲憊不堪、暗流湧動的城市，這裡會成為家族的下一個故土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"只有敘拉古的土地會尊重我們，卡彭，別忘了被趕出那張桌子，夾著尾巴離開敘拉古的恥辱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"信條餵不飽任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾在這座城市定下了規則，只要不過界，我們依舊可以在這裡大展拳腳，龍門需要一些“人情產業”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......有幾年沒見，你越來越讓我感到厭倦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"彼此彼此，首領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別在這裡叭叭叭叭地吵架，這杯劣質氣泡酒已經夠讓我煩躁的了，拿著玻璃瓶，去外面打一架如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"滾開，這不關你事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"注意你的口氣，我才是這裡的老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"順便提供殯葬一條龍包辦，如果你倆有幸同歸於盡，喪葬費打八折。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"喂......這傢伙是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"......從敘拉古離開之後，這就是我們的境遇。沒人還記得你是一個西西里人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰管你是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！卡彭，炸掉這間品味令人作嘔的酒吧，算不算美化市容？魏彥吾不會生氣的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴！別挑釁他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你說誰的品味令人作嘔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]}]}
